Let the permission-mode cycler switch a running Claude session into bypass.

Upstream treats bypassPermissions as launch-only: Claude Code only puts it in
the shift+tab cycle when it was launched into bypass, so once a session left
bypass (approving a plan in the web UI switches to auto or manual) it could
not get back. The runner's claude wrapper now launches Claude with
--allow-dangerously-skip-permissions while claude_bypass_permissions is on, so
bypass is always in the cycle and the cycler may target it. Pairs with images/server/patches/0007 and
images/server/web-patches/0006.
Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

